  "source": "uml ropUmlStructure \"РОП — компоненты, деятельность и развёртывание\"\ndiagram D02_component \"Диаграмма компонентов\" type=component\ncomponent D02_component.ui Веб-интерфейс\nview D02_component.uiView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.ui\ncomponent D02_component.auth \"Проверка прав и аудит\"\nview D02_component.authView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.auth\ncomponent D02_component.bom \"BOM и правила\"\nview D02_component.bomView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.bom\ncomponent D02_component.content \"Расчёты и контент\"\nview D02_component.contentView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.content\ncomponent D02_component.pub \"Публикации и очередь\"\nview D02_component.pubView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.pub\ncomponent D02_component.sup \"Адаптеры поставщиков\"\nview D02_component.supView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.sup\ncomponent D02_component.db \"Репозитории PostgreSQL\"\nview D02_component.dbView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.db\ncomponent D02_component.ext \"PC4Games и ITPartner\"\nview D02_component.extView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.ext\ncomponent D02_component.oz \"Ozon Seller\"\nview D02_component.ozView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.oz\ncomponent D02_component.media \"Хранилище изображений\"\nview D02_component.mediaView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.media\ndependency D02_component.edge1 \"HTTPS / JSON\" from=D02_component.ui to=D02_component.bom\nview view_5719b4fa1db5 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge1 from=D02_component.uiView to=D02_component.bomView\ndependency D02_component.edge2 \"проверка роли\" from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.auth\nview view_fc348c0b5a97 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge2 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.authView\ndependency D02_component.edge3 репозитории from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.db\nview view_b1fa64bbf9c6 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge3 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.dbView\ndependency D02_component.edge4 предложения from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.sup\nview view_52331b2f6c0c \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge4 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.supView\ndependency D02_component.edge5 адаптер from=D02_component.sup to=D02_component.ext\nview view_27991f83dd6d \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge5 from=D02_component.supView to=D02_component.extView\ndependency D02_component.edge6 \"версия BOM\" from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.content\nview view_608185f894c1 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge6 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.contentView\ndependency D02_component.edge7 \"версия карточки\" from=D02_component.content to=D02_component.pub\nview view_93fb7366a562 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge7 from=D02_component.contentView to=D02_component.pubView\ndependency D02_component.edge8 \"HTTPS / JSON\" from=D02_component.pub to=D02_component.oz\nview view_c2ffca077c92 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge8 from=D02_component.pubView to=D02_component.ozView\ndependency D02_component.edge9 файлы from=D02_component.content to=D02_component.media\nview view_a153cfe7ed19 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge9 from=D02_component.contentView to=D02_component.mediaView\nannotation annotation_11cea654b072 \"Модульный монолит. Репозитории и аудит используются всеми бизнес-модулями; повторяющиеся зависимости опущены для читаемости.\"\nview annotation_11cea654b072View \"\" diagram=D02_component element=annotation_11cea654b072\ndiagram D06_activity \"Деятельность по подготовке и публикации карточки\" activity=prepareCard type=activity\nactivity prepareCard \"Деятельность по подготовке и публикации карточки\"\ninitial D06_activity.a \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.aView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.a\naction D06_activity.b \"Выбрать BOM\\nсоздать новую версию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.bView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.b\naction D06_activity.c \"Изменить состав\\nи разрешить группы\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.cView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.c\ndecision D06_activity.d \"Совместимо и\\nданные актуальны?\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.dView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.d\naction D06_activity.e \"Рассчитать показатели\\nподготовить контент\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.eView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.e\naction D06_activity.f \"Утвердить\\nи запустить публикацию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.f\naction D06_activity.g \"Зафиксировать успех\\nили ошибку и уведомить\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.gView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.g\nactivityFinal D06_activity.z \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.zView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.z\naction D06_activity.fix \"Показать конфликт\\nисправить данные\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fixView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.fix\nmerge D06_activity.mergeCorrections \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.continueEditing \"\" from=D06_activity.mergeCorrections owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.c\nview view_e421f8b2bc7b \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.continueEditing from=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView to=D06_activity.cView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge1 \"\" from=D06_activity.a owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.b\nview view_3c514fbda08d \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge1 from=D06_activity.aView to=D06_activity.bView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge2 \"\" from=D06_activity.b own